    },
    {
      "id": "claim_865c608e52bc47a7a97e496d7c6c35c8",
      "statement": "The setup configures exactly two token claims — `latestConsents/tos` and `latestConsents/pp` — by adding them to the `auth` feature's `account-properties-claims` list; there is no team claim, because the orders list permission's readFilter reads `@team._id`, which the server resolves at every request independently of the JWT.",
