      "id": "claim_348fce5a1eac4a738f0b9bba5532c641",
      "statement": "TOS_VERSION and PP_VERSION in src/legal-versions.ts are the single source of current legal versions: the consents permission stamps them into latestConsents via mergeRequest, and the guards rule blocks with HTTP 451 when either acceptance is missing (`not (A and B)`), so bumping the versions forces re-acceptance on the next request while prior acceptances remain in the consents history.",
