      "id": "claim_1285a5992e5a40b18fd64ba58f4ec88d",
      "statement": "Steps run in a fixed order in the defineSetup array: Stripe and accounts configure independently, the consents steps follow accounts because they write against the users collection the accounts feature owns, and the exported appPointsAtService step runs last so a partially applied setup leaves the app on the connect-your-service screen rather than a broken sign-up page.",
